# Always check text files out with LF endings, on every platform.
# A Windows CRLF checkout breaks byte-exact checks and would bake
# CRLF copies of the artwork into the Docker image.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
